        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...When's the next match?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, my apologies, I'd almost forgotten what I was here for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's three days from now, and your opponent will be the Left-hand Knight... 'Left-hand' Tytus Topola.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As a sidenote, Miss Maria, if you accept any of the Knightclub proposals I've put forward to you, then even supposing you have no luck in the Major\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I can still guarantee the legitimacy of your noble knighthood will remain secure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure Miss 'Whislash' Zofia, and the Radiant Knight, far away wherever she is, will both be reassured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I appreciate your kindness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll make Kazimierz recognize the Nearl family. I won't let all my ancestors' efforts go to waste. I WILL prove that the Nearl family deserves its knighthood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, well, you'll prove... in the competition... Tell me, will you prove?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is cooperation with a corporation not the greatest proof a knight could have of her status? When you face your most ardent fans, tourists from all corners of Terra, the loyal clientele of Kazimierz, what is it that you so desperately want to tell them\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014What will you prove?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will prove...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Pardon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, please wait a moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello? Speaking. What? No, I'm currently... Right, I understand. Please, don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regretfully, Miss Maria, it seems I cannot wait for your answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to you, gentlemen, pardon the offense I've caused, and I hope you have a pleasant evening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Keh. Get outta here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_106#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, then. Let me bid you farewell. If you ever change your mind, contact me at any time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Makes me want to hurl seeing that corp slime face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, V... Why'd he know your...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'd like to know myself. Since my grandpappy passed on, been the better half of a century since I heard a soul call my old name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "And his pronunciation was a pile of shit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are getting risky. Knights Association and the corps are looking into us now. Looking into all of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone might've already started making moves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look like that, Maria. You're not alone here. We owe a hell of a lot to your old Grandpa Nearl. We're all\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone here\u2014!? Sorry, we got a casualty\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Flametail Knight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearl...? Uh, let's make this quick\u2014could you help us out here a bit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... well, this sucks... I was looking forward to our arena matchup. Now I get to remember you as my nurse first, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ashlock Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "B-Both of your injuries...! Come on, just come with me, quickly\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, what are you all\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria, you look after the wounded. Don't need to worry about anything else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kowal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's your bow, you old bones!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like they brought company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...They didn't come with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfah. Who're we dealing with? Who sics themselves on competition knights in broad daylight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That kid's an Infected. Let's go see what's what. Might need more than just Maria for this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Marcin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...On my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
